# CodeAlpha AI Chatbot

## Project Overview

AI Chatbot is a Java console-based chatbot developed as part of the CodeAlpha Java Programming Internship.

The chatbot uses rule-based responses to interact with users and answer frequently asked questions.

## Features

- Interactive conversation
- Greeting responses
- Java-related responses
- Programming-related responses
- Internship-related responses
- CodeAlpha-related responses
- Help option
- Thank-you response
- Goodbye response
- Unknown-question handling

## Technologies Used

- Java
- Object-Oriented Programming
- String handling
- Conditional statements
- Scanner

## Project Structure

```text
CodeAlpha_AIChatbot/
│
├── AIChatbot.java
└── README.md
How to Run
Compile
javac AIChatbot.java
Run
java AIChatbot
Example Conversation
You: hello
CodeBot: Hello! 😊 How can I help you?

You: what is java
CodeBot: Java is a popular object-oriented programming language.

You: what is an internship
CodeBot: Internships help students gain practical skills and industry experience.

You: bye
CodeBot: Goodbye! Have a great day! 👋